q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 14.2 Tm 11.6 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Accuracy alone is misleading here: a model that always says ') Tj (<) Tj (=50K' scores 0.761 accuracy but finds no high earners) Tj T* (\(recall 0, F1 0\). I therefore judge models by precision, recall and F1 for the >50K class, plus ROC AUC.) Tj T* ET
